{"seq":3,"slug":"coupon-code-system","title":"券码生成与批量导入","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/coupon-model-batch/coupon-code-system","wordCount":3133,"readingTime":13,"html":"<h1 id=\"券码生成与批量导入\">券码生成与批量导入</h1><p>券码（coupon code）是一种古老而顽固的机制：品牌在包装盒上印一串字符，用户在结算页输入它。它之所以在扫码时代仍然活着，是因为它解决了两类系统解决不了的问题——<strong>离线的物理介质</strong>（宝洁的瓶身上没法贴一个券 ID）和<strong>一次性的外部投放</strong>（线下门店手写、第三方联名、媒体随刊）。而它带来的问题也同样顽固：码是可以被印刷、被截图、被盗、被穷举的字符串，每一个关于码的缺陷都会直接变成钱。</p>\n<p>本文处理券码这一侧：编码设计、生成与批量导入、以及导入过程中的校验与幂等。券码在用户手里的状态与核销路径见 <a href=\"../grant-wallet/coupon-wallet\">用户券卡包与状态管理</a> 与 <a href=\"../lifecycle-ops/writeoff-recovery\">核销、退回与风控防刷</a>；码所属批次的配额与预算约束见 <a href=\"batch-budget\">券批次、总量与预算</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-码是外部可见的凭证-不是内部-id\">核心概念：码是外部可见的凭证，不是内部 ID</h2><p>内部券实例用自增 ID 或雪花 ID 就够了，因为它从不离开系统。券码不同，它必须同时满足四个互相冲突的要求：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>要求</th>\n<th>冲突对象</th>\n<th>工程后果</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>短、可手输</td>\n<td>抗穷举</td>\n<td>需要校验位与限流兜底</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>全局唯一</td>\n<td>短</td>\n<td>需要唯一索引与冲突重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>不可预测</td>\n<td>短、可读</td>\n<td>需要加密随机或 HMAC</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>可批量生成与印刷</td>\n<td>不可预测</td>\n<td>需要脱机生成 + 可重放</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>这四个要求没有全局最优解，只有按场景取权重的解。周年庆包装上的码要短（用户手输），就必须接受抗穷举能力弱，转而在<strong>兑换接口上做严格的限流与风控</strong>；线上短信投放的码可以长（用户点链接），就可以用足随机空间换取抗穷举。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    subgraph 生成侧&#10;      SEED[&quot;随机源 CSPRNG&quot;] --&gt; ENC[&quot;编码 + 校验位&lt;br/&gt;Base32 / CRC&quot;]&#10;      ENC --&gt; BATCHFILE[&quot;生成产物&lt;br/&gt;codes.txt + 指纹&quot;]&#10;      BATCHFILE --&gt; HASH[&quot;入库哈希&lt;br/&gt;SHA-256(code)&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    subgraph 导入侧&#10;      FILE[&quot;运营上传 CSV&quot;] --&gt; VAL[&quot;格式与规则校验&quot;]&#10;      VAL --&gt; DEDUP[&quot;文件内去重&lt;br/&gt;+ 库内冲突检测&quot;]&#10;      DEDUP --&gt; TX[&quot;分批事务入库&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 = 文件指纹&quot;]&#10;      TX --&gt; BIND[&quot;绑定批次&lt;br/&gt;预占预算&quot;]&#10;    end&#10;    HASH --&gt; DEDUP&#10;    BIND --&gt; READY[&quot;可兑换状态&quot;]&#10;    READY --&gt; REDEEM[&quot;用户输入码 → 兑换&quot;]&#10;    REDEEM --&gt; ENC\">graph TD\n    subgraph 生成侧\n      SEED[\"随机源 CSPRNG\"] --&gt; ENC[\"编码 + 校验位&lt;br/&gt;Base32 / CRC\"]\n      ENC --&gt; BATCHFILE[\"生成产物&lt;br/&gt;codes.txt + 指纹\"]\n      BATCHFILE --&gt; HASH[\"入库哈希&lt;br/&gt;SHA-256(code)\"]\n    end\n    subgraph 导入侧\n      FILE[\"运营上传 CSV\"] --&gt; VAL[\"格式与规则校验\"]\n      VAL --&gt; DEDUP[\"文件内去重&lt;br/&gt;+ 库内冲突检测\"]\n      DEDUP --&gt; TX[\"分批事务入库&lt;br/&gt;幂等键 = 文件指纹\"]\n      TX --&gt; BIND[\"绑定批次&lt;br/&gt;预占预算\"]\n    end\n    HASH --&gt; DEDUP\n    BIND --&gt; READY[\"可兑换状态\"]\n    READY --&gt; REDEEM[\"用户输入码 → 兑换\"]\n    REDEEM --&gt; ENC</pre><p>图中最值得注意的一条边是「用户输入码 → 兑换 → 编码」：兑换时的校验过程是编码逻辑的<strong>逆运算</strong>，因此编码算法必须足够简单到能在兑换路径上廉价执行，同时又必须带校验位以便在查库之前就拒掉大部分手输错误。</p>\n<h2 id=\"编码设计-字符集-校验位与哈希存储\">编码设计：字符集、校验位与哈希存储</h2><p><strong>字符集选择。</strong> 用 Base32 而不是 Base16 或 Base64。理由是 Base16 太长（一字节变两字符），Base64 含 <code>+/=</code> 与大小写混用，手输时会频繁出错。Base32 的 32 个字符里还必须剔除易混字符——<code>0/O</code>、<code>1/I/L</code>、<code>2/Z</code>、<code>5/S</code>，得到一个约 27 字符的字母表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRTUVWXYZ23456789\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>ABCDEFGHJKMNPQRTUVWXYZ23456789</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个字母表是 Crockford Base32 思路的实用变体。剔除易混字符的收益直接体现在客服工单量上：手输错误的很大一部分来自视觉混淆而非记忆错误。标准 Base32（RFC 4648）本身也只取 <code>A-Z</code> 与 <code>2-7</code>，刻意不放入 <code>0</code> 与 <code>1</code>，理由正是它们容易与字母混淆（来源：RFC 4648 §6 Base 32 Encoding, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4648.txt）；Crockford\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc4648.txt）；Crockford</a> 变体在此基础上进一步剔除 <code>I</code>/<code>L</code>/<code>O</code>（分别与 <code>1</code>/<code>0</code> 混淆）并给出可选的校验符号（来源：Douglas Crockford, Base 32 Encoding, <a href=\"https://www.crockford.com/base32.html）。\">https://www.crockford.com/base32.html）。</a></p>\n<p><strong>校验位。</strong> 码的最后一位是前若干位的校验位。可以用简单的模运算或 CRC 截断。校验位的价值是把「格式错误的码」在<strong>不查数据库</strong>的情况下拒掉。若随机输入的字符命中概率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>27</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/27</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/27</span></span></span></span></span>，一位校验位把无效输入拦截率提高到约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>27</mn><mo>≈</mo><mn>96.3</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - 1/27 \\approx 96.3\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/27</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">96.3%</span></span></span></span></span>，两位则达到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>99.86</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">99.86\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">99.86%</span></span></span></span></span>。这类校验位的实际检出能力有成熟参照：Luhn（mod 10）算法可检出全部单字符错误与几乎所有相邻换位错误（来源：Luhn algorithm, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luhn_algorithm）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Luhn_algorithm）。</a></p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>有效码空间</mtext><mo>=</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>无效输入拦截率</mtext><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{有效码空间} = 27^{n-1}, \\qquad \\text{无效输入拦截率} = 1 - 27^{-k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">有效码空间</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0585em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8641em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">无效输入拦截率</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8991em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.113em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>其中 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 是码长、<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>k</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">k</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span> 是校验位数。这个公式决定了码长取舍：一个含 1 位校验的 10 位码有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>27</mn><mn>9</mn></msup><mo>≈</mo><mn>7.6</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27^9 \\approx 7.6 \\times 10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7.6</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 个可能值。若某个批次只发 100 万张，穷举命中率约为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1.3</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>7</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1.3 \\times 10^{-7}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">7</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 每试——看似安全，但攻击者可以每秒试 1000 次、持续一天，命中期望就上升到约 11 张券。因此<strong>码长不能替代限流</strong>，两者必须同时存在。</p>\n<p><strong>存储方式有三种，安全等级递增：</strong></p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>兑换路径</th>\n<th>泄露风险</th>\n<th>适用</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>明文</td>\n<td>直接索引查询</td>\n<td>库被读即全部码泄露</td>\n<td>低价值券、内部码</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>哈希（加盐）</td>\n<td>对输入哈希后查询</td>\n<td>需逐码爆破</td>\n<td>高价值券</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>HMAC（固定密钥）</td>\n<td>对输入做 HMAC 后查询</td>\n<td>密钥不出主控即安全</td>\n<td>大批量高价值券</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>HMAC 方案比加盐哈希更适合券码，因为券码空间本身很小（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>27</mn><mn>9</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27^9</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">9</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>），加盐哈希面对暴力破解的强度只取决于单码的熵，而攻击者是可以对每个候选码现算的。HMAC 引入了密钥，把「拿到码表哈希」与「能算出码」彻底分开——只要密钥在 KMS 而不是数据库里，码表泄露不等于码泄露。HMAC 的定义即「用共享密钥结合任意迭代式密码哈希函数做的消息认证」（来源：RFC 2104 HMAC: Keyed-Hashing for Message Authentication, <a href=\"https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.txt）。\">https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2104.txt）。</a></p>\n<p>需要注意：<strong>HMAC 也带来一个运营代价</strong>。一旦密钥轮换，历史码的查询必须用旧密钥。因此密钥必须版本化并长期保留（轮换的是新码用的版本，不是删除旧版本）。这个约束在系统设计初期不写清楚，轮换时会变成一次无法收尾的迁移。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量生成-脱机生成-可重放\">批量生成：脱机生成 + 可重放</h2><p>十万张码的生成不是一次数据库插入，而是一次<strong>可重放的脱机过程</strong>，因为码表通常要交给第三方印刷厂，中间隔着数周时间。</p>\n<p>生成的产物必须是两个文件而不是一个：<code>codes.csv</code>（明码）与 <code>codes.sha256</code>（每行哈希或整体指纹）。印厂拿到明码，系统只保存哈希与指纹。这个分离是安全设计的核心——如果系统里存了明码表，那么它在印刷厂泄露时毫无缓冲。</p>\n<p>生成过程必须解决的唯一性是：从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>27</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">27^{n-1}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 空间里抽 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 个不重复的值。两种做法：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>拒绝采样 + 去重集合</strong>：抽到重复就重抽。当 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 远小于空间大小（例如 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>6</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">6</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 对比 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>12</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">10^{12}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">12</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）时，冲突概率约 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>⋅</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2 / (2 \\cdot 27^{n-1})</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0641em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">n</span><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">1</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，可以忽略。</li>\n<li><strong>Feistel / 伪随机置换</strong>：用一个密钥化的置换函数把序号 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1..</mn><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1..N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1..</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 映射成空间内的唯一值，从而<strong>天然无重复</strong>且可以按序号重算。这是更适合超大批量（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N &gt; 10^8</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">8</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）的做法，代价是置换函数的实现复杂度。Feistel 网络的价值恰在于「即使轮函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 本身不可逆，整体置换仍保证可逆」，且三轮即可在 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>F</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">F</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">F</span></span></span></span></span> 为安全伪随机函数时给出伪随机置换（来源：Feistel cipher, <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feistel_cipher）。\">https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Feistel_cipher）。</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>生成脚本必须记录<strong>生成参数</strong>（字母表、码长、校验位算法、随机种子或密钥版本、批次数），写进一个 manifest。理由是排查线上问题时，最需要回答的问题是「这张码是不是我们生成的、属于哪个批次」，而 manifest 是这个问题唯一的答案。</p>\n<h2 id=\"批量导入-文件指纹幂等与分批事务\">批量导入：文件指纹幂等与分批事务</h2><p>导入是运营的日常操作，也是最容易出事的地方，因为它涉及外部文件、人工操作与大事务。遵循三条规则可以规避绝大多数事故。</p>\n<p><strong>规则一：以文件指纹为幂等键。</strong> 运营重复上传同一个 CSV 是最常见的人为错误。解决办法是导入前先算文件的 SHA-256 指纹并作为唯一键登记：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"CREATE TABLE coupon_import_task (&#10;  id           BIGINT PRIMARY KEY AUTO_INCREMENT,&#10;  batch_id     VARCHAR(32) NOT NULL,&#10;  file_digest  CHAR(64)    NOT NULL,&#10;  file_rows    INT         NOT NULL,&#10;  accepted     INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  rejected     INT         NOT NULL DEFAULT 0,&#10;  status       ENUM(&#39;VALIDATING&#39;,&#39;IMPORTING&#39;,&#39;DONE&#39;,&#39;FAILED&#39;) NOT NULL,&#10;  created_at   DATETIME(3) NOT NULL,&#10;  UNIQUE KEY uk_digest (file_digest)&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CREATE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TABLE</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> coupon_import_task</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  id           </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">BIGINT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> PRIMARY KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> AUTO_INCREMENT,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  batch_id     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VARCHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">32</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  file_digest  </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CHAR</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">64</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  file_rows    </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  accepted     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  rejected     </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">         NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> DEFAULT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">       ENUM(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'VALIDATING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'IMPORTING'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'DONE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'FAILED'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  created_at   </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DATETIME</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">3</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NOT NULL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  UNIQUE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> KEY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> uk_digest (file_digest)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>同一份文件第二次上传会撞唯一键，此时返回第一次的导入结果而不是重跑。注意这里用<strong>文件整体指纹</strong>而不是逐行的幂等键：逐行幂等在导入这种批量场景里会产生「部分成功」的中间态，而部分成功的批次比失败更难处理。</p>\n<p><strong>规则二：校验先于写入。</strong> 导入必须分两个阶段：VALIDATING 阶段只读不写，产出「哪些行合格、哪些行被拒、为什么」。这一步让运营在写库之前看到结果，也避免了「写了一半发现第 8000 行格式错」这种状态。常见的校验项：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>校验项</th>\n<th>拒绝原因</th>\n<th>可否自动修</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符集非法（含 <code>O</code>/<code>I</code>）</td>\n<td>视觉混淆字符</td>\n<td>可尝试映射为大写后重试</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>校验位不符</td>\n<td>码被篡改或印刷错</td>\n<td>否</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>文件内重复</td>\n<td>运营拼表重复</td>\n<td>可去重并报告</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>库内已存在</td>\n<td>与历史批次撞码</td>\n<td>否，需重新生成</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>批次配额不足</td>\n<td>导入量 &gt; 剩余配额</td>\n<td>否，需补配额</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>规则三：分批小事务写入。</strong> 一次性插入十万行会长时间持有锁与大量 undo，还可能在中途失败留下部分数据。正确做法是按固定大小（如 2000 行）分批提交，每批独立事务、独立幂等（用 <code>(import_task_id, chunk_no)</code> 作幂等键），失败可从上一个成功的分片续跑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"INSERT INTO coupon_code (code_hash, batch_id, import_task_id, chunk_no, status)&#10;VALUES (?, ?, ?, ?, &#39;AVAILABLE&#39;)&#10;ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE code_hash = code_hash;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">INSERT INTO</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> coupon_code (code_hash, batch_id, import_task_id, chunk_no, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">status</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">VALUES</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (?, ?, ?, ?, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'AVAILABLE'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ON</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DUPLICATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">KEY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> UPDATE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code_hash </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> code_hash;</span></span></code></pre></div><p><code>ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE</code> 的写法让单行重复变成无害操作而非报错——这是导入场景的正确选择，因为运营更希望「跳过重复行、继续导入」，而不是整批回滚。要注意官方语义细节：该语句在撞唯一键时不插入新行而改为 UPDATE 已存在行，受影响行数返回 1（插入）/ 2（更新）/ 0（值未变），因此「跳过重复行」的受影响行数为 0（来源：MySQL 8.4 INSERT ... ON DUPLICATE KEY UPDATE, <a href=\"https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/insert-on-duplicate.html）。但要注意这种方式会掩盖「撞码」这一异常信号，因此必须同时统计受影响行数并与预期比对，把差异写进导入报告的\">https://dev.mysql.com/doc/refman/8.4/en/insert-on-duplicate.html）。但要注意这种方式会掩盖「撞码」这一异常信号，因此必须同时统计受影响行数并与预期比对，把差异写进导入报告的</a> rejected 计数。</p>\n<h2 id=\"导入后的绑定与可观测\">导入后的绑定与可观测</h2><p>码入库后进入 AVAILABLE，此时还没绑定到任何用户。绑定发生在用户兑换的瞬间，或由运营定向绑定（把码表分发给特定渠道时预绑定）。这个两段结构让同一批码可以有两种投放方式，而不需要两套码表。</p>\n<p>导入任务必须产出可核对的三类数字：<strong>文件行数、接受数、拒绝数</strong>，且满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>file_rows</mtext><mo>=</mo><mtext>accepted</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>rejected</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>skipped_duplicates</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{file\\_rows} = \\text{accepted} + \\text{rejected} + \\text{skipped\\_duplicates}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">file_rows</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">accepted</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">rejected</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0044em;vertical-align:-0.31em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">skipped_duplicates</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这个等式不成立就说明导入器本身有缺陷（读到一半崩溃、编码判断错误），而不是数据有问题。把它做成导入报告的强制项，可以让一个有 bug 的导入器在第一次使用时就暴露，而不是在月度对账时。</p>\n<p>可观测面上，导入至少需要三个指标：导入耗时（按行数归一）、拒绝率（按拒绝原因分组）、以及<strong>码兑换成功率</strong>。第三个指标是最容易被忽略但最重要的——如果印厂把某个字符印错，兑换失败会以「用户输入无效码」的形式出现，而没有任何系统告警。简单的检测方法是统计兑换接口的「校验位不符」比例，若某批次显著高于基线，说明该批次的印刷或码表有系统性缺陷。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>券码是外部可见凭证，四个要求（短、唯一、不可预测、可批量）互相冲突，只能按场景取权重，<strong>码长永远不能替代兑换接口的限流与风控</strong>。</li>\n<li>字符集用剔除易混字符的 Base32 变体；校验位把无效输入在查库前拦掉，拦截率为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mo>−</mo><msup><mn>27</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mi>k</mi></mrow></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1 - 27^{-k}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8491em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">−</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0315em;\">k</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>存储优先用<strong>版本化密钥的 HMAC</strong> 而非明文或加盐哈希；密钥轮换要保留旧版本，否则历史码无法查询。</li>\n<li>批量生成走<strong>脱机生成 + 明码/哈希分离 + manifest</strong>，明码只给印厂、系统只存哈希与指纹。</li>\n<li>导入以<strong>文件整体指纹</strong>为幂等键，先校验后写入，分批小事务提交，并把「文件行数 = 接受 + 拒绝 + 跳过」作为强制核对项。</li>\n<li>兑换失败率按批次监控，是发现印刷与码表系统性缺陷的唯一手段。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"券码生成与批量导入","id":"券码生成与批量导入"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：码是外部可见的凭证，不是内部 ID","id":"核心概念-码是外部可见的凭证-不是内部-id"},{"level":2,"text":"编码设计：字符集、校验位与哈希存储","id":"编码设计-字符集-校验位与哈希存储"},{"level":2,"text":"批量生成：脱机生成 + 可重放","id":"批量生成-脱机生成-可重放"},{"level":2,"text":"批量导入：文件指纹幂等与分批事务","id":"批量导入-文件指纹幂等与分批事务"},{"level":2,"text":"导入后的绑定与可观测","id":"导入后的绑定与可观测"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"券批次、总量与预算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/coupon-model-batch/batch-budget"},"next":{"title":"领取原子扣减与防超发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/global-ecommerce/coupon-center-lifecycle/grant-wallet/claim-oversell-defense"}}